{"file": "我李长生重回八零，赶山狩猎养妻女-第158集.mp4", "ep": 158, "duration": 40.1, "segments": [{"start": 1.59, "end": 2.23, "text": "长生哥"}, {"start": 2.63, "end": 3.47, "text": "又来东西了"}, {"start": 4.67, "end": 5.55, "text": "不是东西"}, {"start": 5.83, "end": 6.55, "text": "是人"}, {"start": 11.82, "end": 12.3, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 12.74, "end": 13.98, "text": "就是那帮军用交鞋"}, {"start": 14.42, "end": 15.46, "text": "运气不错"}, {"start": 16.22, "end": 17.06, "text": "熊胆留下"}, {"start": 20.7, "end": 21.82, "text": "林子里的规矩"}, {"start": 22.3, "end": 23.9, "text": "见一面分一半"}, {"start": 24.53, "end": 25.69, "text": "那是大伙客气"}, {"start": 25.89, "end": 27.09, "text": "给山神言面子"}, {"start": 27.8, "end": 28.84, "text": "拿钱砸人"}, {"start": 29.0, "end": 29.68, "text": "硬抢"}, {"start": 30.36, "end": 31.4, "text": "你们不够搁"}, {"start": 32.28, "end": 32.92, "text": "老乡"}, {"start": 33.0, "end": 34.4, "text": "你还没搞清楚状况吧"}, {"start": 36.95, "end": 38.11, "text": "我不是跟你商量"}, {"start": 38.83, "end": 39.95, "text": "我是通知你"}]}